      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another thought: Did you try the suggestion [here](http://b/419617755#comment33) for limiting the include path based on `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC`? You would need to change this to `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC\u003dn` in that case. That might be a more general way to configure this build closer to upstream Zephyr.\n\n@dawidn@google.com Do you have any thoughts?",
